# Device patches and os-series replacements, one per line in application order.
#
# This file replaces os:patches/xnu/series, which lists exactly three entries:
# zzz-boot-progress.patch and the two XnuPrelink kit patches. patch_series
# entries are series files, so those three are repeated here with the first one
# pointing at the device copy.
#
# zzz-boot-progress.patch is that device copy. It drops one hunk in
# bsd/kern/bsd_init.c that wraps sheng_pmgr_run() in boot_progress_stage()
# calls: that block only exists after a Qualcomm SoC's sheng-platform-power
# patch, which GS101 does not apply, so the os copy fails to apply here
# ("patch does not apply" at bsd_init.c:773). Everything else is unchanged.
